  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>etomidate</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>N01AX07</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>van Beem H et al. 1983</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>patients with cirrhosis of the liver</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>etomidate</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_etomidate/Etomidate_van1983_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>mean half-life</td><td>540</td><td>minutes</td><td><small>t1/2z</small></td></tr><tr><td>volume of distribution</td><td>8.9</td><td>litres/kg</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>Clearance</td><td>12.7</td><td>ml/kg/minute</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr></table><h4>About etomidate</h4><p>Etomidate is an intravenous general anesthetic and sedative-hypnotic, used to induce anesthesia and studied for conditions such as status epilepticus and brain ischemia. It is an approved medicine, used mainly in hospital settings for anesthesia induction.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q418445\">Wikidata Q418445</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Etomidate\">Etomidate</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>van Beem H et al. (1983). Etomidate anaesthesia in patients with cirrhosis of the liver: pharmacokinetic data. <i>Anaesthesia 38 Suppl:61–62</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1365-2044.1983.tb15181.x\">10.1111/j.1365-2044.1983.tb15181.x</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/6869758\">6869758</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from van_1983: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
